From `C:/Users/tocha/projects/sistema-zero-python-review-fixes`, after review of the actual manifest and its SHA:

```powershell
& 'C:/Users/tocha/projects/sistema-zero-python/.cache/studio-python-l0/node-v24.22.0/node-v24.22.0-win-x64/node.exe' `
  '.cache/python-reference-games/production-postgres-final-backup-r1.mjs' `
